  "intro": {
    "title": "Zum Arzt, zu teuer, zu",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Zu has three jobs. Preposition: to (zum Arzt, zur Arbeit, zu mir). Adverb: too (zu teuer). And: closed (Die Tür ist zu). As a preposition it always takes the dative: zu dem → zum, zu der → zur."
    ]
  },
